    - rid: 3832489796472668234
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Well, of course I didn''t want to get nosy on her.

          I''ve
          known her for a while and I''ve learned that the last thing you want is
          to see her angry.

          The things she could do to you if you dared
          to do so... Better not learn what she''s sensitive about, that''s what
          I say.'
        characterEmotion: 2
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 3
        isKey: 0
