    - rid: 5324356914828018035
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Resent her? She single-handedly financed my career as a chef
          and gave me years of unconditional love.

          Even if I didn''t still
          love her (which I do), I have a debt with her that i doubt I''ll ever be
          able to pay... *sigh*'
